// expect: 99
// Arithmetic on a word's bits performs nothing: `i32_xor` and `i32_shl` are
// primitives, so `mix` keeps `with Pure`. The boot before refused it
// ("expected Pure but found effects: Memory"), because the library declared
// the word operations as ops of Memory.
fn mix(x) with Pure = i32_xor(x, i32_shl(x, 5))

fn main() = mix(3)
